<title>NORWAY: Norway Central Bank announces ad-hoc T-bill issue.</title>
<headline>Norway Central Bank announces ad-hoc T-bill issue.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's central bank, Norges Bank, said on Friday it would hold an ad-hoc issue of a new treasury bill with a maturity to November 17, 1997.</p>
<p>The bank said details of the new T-bill will be released on July 8 and the auction will take place on July 10.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
